Phone IP Camera lets you turn your device into a remove camera (IP Cam) in order to surveil, spy and check whatever you want, i.e. your house, your pet, your baby and similar.
It is also a good anti-theft device thanks to its motion detection feature.

This version does NOT require any subscription, this is a LIFE license.

Main features:
- Turns your devices into a remote camera;
- Access the camera from any device through a browser*;
- Video + Audio feed;
- Motion Detection: after a detection the camera will start recording and will send you a push notification to all the enabled devices;
- Remote TTS, make the camera talk;
- Support for slow connections, change quality and speed settings;
- Enable/Disable Flash remotely;
- Username + Password login;
- Disable audio for privacy;
- Good security level, only you know your address, your username and your password!
- Works also both in portrait and landscape modes;
- No registration and no subscriptions required.

* In order to access the camera from external connections you will need to perform a port forwarding on your router otherwise it will work in lan mode only.

The program forms a list of families and the composition of the family. It is designed to store family history and build a family tree. Saves photos and video documents. The tree is built on graphic and hypertext canvas.
Functions of the program:
- compiling a list of families;
- drawing up a list of persons in families;
- family description and biography of people;
- construction of a genealogical tree (2D, 3D);
- construction of the genealogical branch (2D, 3D);
- construction of the ring genealogical table;
- compilation of the list of generations;
- drawing calendar family of events;
- compilation of the genealogy of the family book;
- compilation of family and personal photo albums;
- compilation of family and personal video archives;
- stores phenotype and DNA data of persons
- export / import of data into the archive;
- Export / import GEDCOM.
